AgriCare LK Android APK v2.0.0 (Smart Agro AI Edition)
Package: com.agricare.lk.app
Target: Android 8.0+
Framework: Flutter 3.x + TensorFlow MobileNetV2
Language: Sinhala (100%)

To build the full release APK locally:
1. Open terminal in agricare_app directory
2. Run: flutter build apk --release
3. Find APK at: agricare_app/build/app/outputs/flutter-apk/app-release.apk

